  "prompt": "For each parent category, what was the average number of days from a product's launch_date to the UTC day of its first sale, over the products launched on or after 1 January 2024 that have sold? Count the days between the two dates, so a first sale on the launch day counts as 0, and average over products, not over sales. Round to 1 decimal. Return two columns, in this order: parent_category, and avg_days_to_first_sale. Return one row for each parent category with such products. Any row order is fine.",
